{#
  Icon contract (Phase 10.4A).

  Inline SVG keyed by a fixed name. The `name` argument is compared to
  literals only — it is never interpolated into the markup — so no
  user-controlled value can ever enter the SVG. Unknown names match no
  branch and render nothing (safe fallback).

  Every icon is decorative: each SVG carries aria-hidden="true" and
  focusable="false". The visible label always travels with the icon, so the
  icon needs no accessible name of its own.

  No external CDN, no remote font. These are local static inline SVGs.
  Styling is intentionally minimal here; full icon/sidebar styling arrives
  in a later phase.
#}
{% macro icon(name) -%}
{%- if name == 'dashboard' -%}
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>
{%- elif name == 'projects' -%}
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/></svg>
{%- elif name == 'releases' -%}
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4"/></svg>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
